@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/app
@presentationId = <presentationId>
@slideId = <slideId>

# ─── Slides ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### POST /presentations/:id/slides/generate — gerar slides (background via Inngest — responde 202 {status:"pending", generationId} na hora; poll em GET /presentations/:id/slides)
POST {{baseUrl}}/presentations/{{presentationId}}/slides/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outlines": [
    {
      "outlineId": "outline-id-1",
      "type": 0,
      "title": "Capa",
      "description": "Slide de abertura da apresentação",
      "concepts": ["IA", "automação"],
      "representation": 0,
      "layout": "cover"
    },
    {
      "outlineId": "outline-id-2",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "O impacto da IA no mercado",
      "description": "Análise das mudanças causadas pela automação",
      "concepts": ["desemprego estrutural", "novos empregos", "requalificação"],
      "representation": 1,
      "layout": "two-columns"
    }
  ]
}

###

### GET /presentations/:id/slides — listar slides
GET {{baseUrl}}/presentations/{{presentationId}}/slides

###

### POST /presentations/:id/slides — criar slide(s) manualmente (Studio, onAddSlide persistido só no save) — cria o outline junto (cover se for o 1º da presentation, senão content)
POST {{baseUrl}}/presentations/{{presentationId}}/slides
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slides": [
    { "tempId": "temp-1", "order": 0, "title": "Novo slide" }
  ]
}

###

### PATCH /presentations/:id/slides — salvar estado dos slides (editor)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/presentations/{{presentationId}}/slides
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slides": [
    {
      "id": "slide-id-1",
      "elements": [],
      "appState": {}
    }
  ]
}

###

### POST /presentations/:id/slides/:slideId/generate — regenerar slide individual (síncrono — resolve dentro da própria request, sem Inngest/polling)
POST {{baseUrl}}/presentations/{{presentationId}}/slides/{{slideId}}/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outlineId": "outline-id-1",
  "type": 1,
  "title": "O impacto da IA no mercado",
  "description": "Análise das mudanças causadas pela automação",
  "concepts": ["desemprego estrutural", "novos empregos", "requalificação"],
  "representation": 1,
  "layout": "two-columns"
}

###

### POST /presentations/:id/slides/:slideId/thumbnail — define a capa (texto SVG já renderizado no client, exportToSvg) — capa da presentation
POST {{baseUrl}}/presentations/{{presentationId}}/slides/{{slideId}}/thumbnail
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thumbnail": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"></svg>"
}
